[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m From this, we can identify the constants \(b\) and \(c\) as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m b = 1.3, \quad c = 2.4551
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m 4. Calculate \(b + c\):
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3408)[0m b + c = 1.3 + 2.4551 = 3.7551
